Build Options:

Target: Windows | Linux | macOS
Arch: x86 | x86_64 | arm64

allocator: libC | mimalloc
string: libC+W | icu4c | utf8proc+w

libC: gnu | musl | cosmopolitan

musl deveria ser o padrão... pelo que vi (2024) já é supera o glibc em varias coisas: https://wiki.musl-libc.org/functional-differences-from-glibc.html

Profiles: Debug | Release | ReleaseFast | ReleaseSmall

*** Relese usa mimalloc safe alloc + O3 -fpie; ReleaseFast default allocator + Ofast -fno-fast-math -fPIE; 

LinkerType: Dynamic | Static // default static (libs usando -fPIC)

Installer: msi, deb/rpm, dmg e ???

